---
source: cli/src/airs_help_tests.rs
expression: typesafe.render_long_help().to_string()
---
Manage the optional TypeSafe judge API key for an environment

Usage: airs env typesafe <COMMAND>

Commands:
  set     Save a TypeSafe API key for this environment (hidden input, or --stdin)
  status  Show whether a TypeSafe key is configured, without revealing it
  exec    Run the bundled judge with TypeSafe variables scoped to its child process
  clear   Remove the saved TypeSafe key and settings from this environment
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
